<title>JAPAN: Bellsystem -96/97 div forecast.</title>
<headline>Bellsystem -96/97 div forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to May 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> div		    50.00 yen	  21.00 yen	 26.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Bellsystem24 Inc is a telemarketer and part of the CSK group. The latest dividend figure includes</p>
<p>ordinary and commemorative dividend, but the company said it</p>
<p>had not decided on how much it would pay as commemorative</p>
<p>dividend. It paid ordinary dividend of 10.00 yen and special</p>
<p>dividend of 16.50 yen in the year to May 1996.</p>
</text>
